{"seq":3,"slug":"optics-lens-prism","title":"光学：Lens、Prism 与 Traversal","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/patterns/optics-lens-prism","wordCount":820,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"光学-lens-prism-与-traversal\">光学：Lens、Prism 与 Traversal</h1><p>不可变数据结构有一个实际痛点：当你需要修改深层嵌套字段时，手动逐层解构再重建的代码极其冗长。光学（Optics）——Lens、Prism、Traversal 等一族组合子——优雅地解决了这个问题。它们为不可变数据提供了「可组合的 getter/setter」，让你像操作可变字段一样精确地访问和更新深层嵌套结构，同时保持不可变性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>光学是不可变数据的「指针算术」——它为深层嵌套的不可变结构提供类型安全的、可组合的访问与更新路径。Lens 聚焦积类型中确定存在的字段，Prism 聚焦和类型中可能存在的变体，Traversal 同时聚焦多个目标。三者可自由组合，构成从根到叶的任意路径，类型系统自动追踪路径的「可能性」（总是存在 vs 可能缺失 vs 有多个）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"问题-嵌套不可变数据的更新之苦\">问题：嵌套不可变数据的更新之苦</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 想要修改 company.ceo.address.city&#10;// 不可变的手动更新：&#10;const updated = {&#10;  ...company,&#10;  ceo: {&#10;    ...company.ceo,&#10;    address: {&#10;      ...company.ceo.address,&#10;      city: &#39;Shanghai&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;// 嵌套越深，样板代码越多\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 想要修改 company.ceo.address.city</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不可变的手动更新：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> updated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">company,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ceo: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">company.ceo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    address: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">company.ceo.address,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      city: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Shanghai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 嵌套越深，样板代码越多</span></span></code></pre></div><p>光学提供的解法：定义一条「聚焦路径」，然后在该路径上执行 get/set/modify：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 用 Lens 组合&#10;const cityLens = Lens.company.ceo.address.city;&#10;const updated = cityLens.set(&#39;Shanghai&#39;)(company);&#10;const current = cityLens.get(company); // &quot;Beijing&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用 Lens 组合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cityLens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Lens.company.ceo.address.city;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> updated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cityLens.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Shanghai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(company);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cityLens.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(company); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"Beijing\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"lens-聚焦积类型的单个字段\">Lens：聚焦积类型的单个字段</h2><p>Lens 是最基础的光学——它聚焦于一个积类型（record/struct）中的<strong>确定存在的字段</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    S[&quot;Source S&quot;] --&gt;|get| A[&quot;Focus A&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt;|&quot;set(a)&quot;| S2[&quot;Updated S&quot;]&#10;    L1[&quot;Lens S A&quot;] --&gt; L2[&quot;Lens A B&quot;]&#10;    L1 ---|compose| L3[&quot;Lens S B&quot;]\">graph LR\n    S[\"Source S\"] --&gt;|get| A[\"Focus A\"]\n    S --&gt;|\"set(a)\"| S2[\"Updated S\"]\n    L1[\"Lens S A\"] --&gt; L2[\"Lens A B\"]\n    L1 ---|compose| L3[\"Lens S B\"]</pre><p>一个 Lens 由两个操作定义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Lens</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>get</mtext><mo>:</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>set</mtext><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Lens}[S, A] = \\{ \\text{get}: S \\to A,\\; \\text{set}: A \\to S \\to S \\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Lens</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">get</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">set</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Lens 满足三条法则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Get-Set</strong>：<code>set(get(s))(s) = s</code>（设回读到的值不改变原结构）</li>\n<li><strong>Set-Get</strong>：<code>get(set(a)(s)) = a</code>（读出刚设的值就是那个值）</li>\n<li><strong>Set-Set</strong>：<code>set(a2)(set(a1)(s)) = set(a2)(s)</code>（连续设置取最后一次）</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>光学类型</th>\n<th>聚焦目标</th>\n<th>目标数量</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Lens</td>\n<td>积类型字段</td>\n<td>恰好 1 个</td>\n<td>record 字段访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prism</td>\n<td>和类型变体</td>\n<td>0 或 1 个</td>\n<td>enum/union 分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Optional</td>\n<td>可能缺失的值</td>\n<td>0 或 1 个</td>\n<td>Option/nullable 字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traversal</td>\n<td>多个目标</td>\n<td>0 到 N 个</td>\n<td>列表/集合中的元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Iso</td>\n<td>双向无损转换</td>\n<td>恰好 1 个</td>\n<td>类型同构映射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"prism-聚焦和类型的变体\">Prism：聚焦和类型的变体</h2><p>Prism 处理和类型（Sum Type）——目标可能不存在。它提供 <code>preview</code>（尝试匹配）和 <code>review</code>（从变体构造整体）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- Haskell: 为 JSON 值定义 Prism&#10;_JsonString :: Prism&#39; JsonValue String&#10;_JsonNumber :: Prism&#39; JsonValue Double&#10;&#10;-- preview: 尝试提取（可能失败返回 Nothing）&#10;preview _JsonString (JsonString &quot;hello&quot;) -- Just &quot;hello&quot;&#10;preview _JsonString (JsonNumber 42)      -- Nothing&#10;&#10;-- review: 从变体构造&#10;review _JsonString &quot;world&quot;               -- JsonString &quot;world&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Haskell: 为 JSON 值定义 Prism</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>_JsonString :: Prism' JsonValue String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>_JsonNumber :: Prism' JsonValue Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- preview: 尝试提取（可能失败返回 Nothing）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>preview _JsonString (JsonString \"hello\") -- Just \"hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>preview _JsonString (JsonNumber 42)      -- Nothing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- review: 从变体构造</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>review _JsonString \"world\"               -- JsonString \"world\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Prism 的价值在和 Lens 组合时显现：<code>Lens . Prism = Optional</code>——一条路径中既有确定字段又有可能不存在的变体时，类型系统自动跟踪可能性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合-光学的核心力量\">组合：光学的核心力量</h2><p>光学的杀手锏是<strong>可组合性</strong>——两个光学可以像函数那样组合成一个新的光学，类型自动推导。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scala\" data-code=\"// Scala (Monocle 库)&#10;import monocle.syntax.all._&#10;&#10;case class Street(name: String, number: Int)&#10;case class Address(street: Street, city: String)&#10;case class Person(name: String, address: Address)&#10;&#10;// 组合 Lens&#10;val streetName = Focus[Person](_.address.street.name)&#10;&#10;// 使用&#10;val john = Person(&quot;John&quot;, Address(Street(&quot;Main St&quot;, 42), &quot;NYC&quot;))&#10;streetName.get(john)                    // &quot;Main St&quot;&#10;streetName.replace(&quot;Broadway&quot;)(john)    // Person(...Street(&quot;Broadway&quot;, 42)...)&#10;streetName.modify(_.toUpperCase)(john)  // Person(...Street(&quot;MAIN ST&quot;, 42)...)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Scala (Monocle 库)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import monocle.syntax.all._</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>case class Street(name: String, number: Int)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>case class Address(street: Street, city: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>case class Person(name: String, address: Address)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 组合 Lens</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val streetName = Focus[Person](_.address.street.name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val john = Person(\"John\", Address(Street(\"Main St\", 42), \"NYC\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>streetName.get(john)                    // \"Main St\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>streetName.replace(\"Broadway\")(john)    // Person(...Street(\"Broadway\", 42)...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>streetName.modify(_.toUpperCase)(john)  // Person(...Street(\"MAIN ST\", 42)...)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    LP[Lens[Person, Address]&quot;]&#10;    LA[Lens[Address, Street]&quot;]&#10;    LS[Lens[Street, String]&quot;]&#10;    LP --&gt; LA --&gt; LS&#10;    LP ---|&quot;compose&quot;| C[Lens[Person, String]&quot;]\">graph LR\n    LP[Lens[Person, Address]\"]\n    LA[Lens[Address, Street]\"]\n    LS[Lens[Street, String]\"]\n    LP --&gt; LA --&gt; LS\n    LP ---|\"compose\"| C[Lens[Person, String]\"]</pre><h2 id=\"traversal-聚焦多个目标\">Traversal：聚焦多个目标</h2><p>Traversal 将 Lens 泛化到可以同时聚焦<strong>零个或多个</strong>目标。它是对 <code>Traversable</code> typeclass 的光学表示。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- 修改列表中所有元素&#10;over (each . _1) (+1) [(1,&quot;a&quot;), (2,&quot;b&quot;), (3,&quot;c&quot;)]&#10;-- [(2,&quot;a&quot;), (3,&quot;b&quot;), (4,&quot;c&quot;)]&#10;&#10;-- 修改 JSON 对象中所有数字值&#10;over (key &quot;data&quot; . values . _Number) (*2) jsonObj\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 修改列表中所有元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>over (each . _1) (+1) [(1,\"a\"), (2,\"b\"), (3,\"c\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- [(2,\"a\"), (3,\"b\"), (4,\"c\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 修改 JSON 对象中所有数字值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>over (key \"data\" . values . _Number) (*2) jsonObj</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"工业级光学库\">工业级光学库</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>库</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Haskell</td>\n<td><code>lens</code> (kmett)</td>\n<td>最完整，300+ 光学类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Haskell</td>\n<td><code>optics</code></td>\n<td>更清晰的 API，用 profunctor 编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scala</td>\n<td><code>Monocle 3</code></td>\n<td>Scala 3 原生，宏生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td><code>Effect/Optic</code> (Effect v4)</td>\n<td>品牌类型模拟，tree-shakable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kotlin</td>\n<td><code>Arrow Optics</code></td>\n<td>Kotlin DSL 风格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>社区探索中，trait 限制较大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>光学为不可变数据提供可组合的 getter/setter</li>\n<li>Lens 聚焦积类型字段，Prism 聚焦和类型变体</li>\n<li>光学可链式组合，类型系统自动推导结果类型</li>\n<li>Traversal 泛化到多目标；Iso 处理类型同构</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../type-systems/algebraic-data-types\">代数数据类型与模式匹配</a> — Lens/Prism 操作的数据结构基础</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../haskell-pure-functional/type-system/advanced-extensions\">Haskell hub：高级扩展</a> — Haskell 中光学依赖的类型扩展（RankNTypes、Profunctor）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"光学：Lens、Prism 与 Traversal","id":"光学-lens-prism-与-traversal"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"问题：嵌套不可变数据的更新之苦","id":"问题-嵌套不可变数据的更新之苦"},{"level":2,"text":"Lens：聚焦积类型的单个字段","id":"lens-聚焦积类型的单个字段"},{"level":2,"text":"Prism：聚焦和类型的变体","id":"prism-聚焦和类型的变体"},{"level":2,"text":"组合：光学的核心力量","id":"组合-光学的核心力量"},{"level":2,"text":"Traversal：聚焦多个目标","id":"traversal-聚焦多个目标"},{"level":2,"text":"工业级光学库","id":"工业级光学库"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Effect System 与类型化副作用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/patterns/effect-systems"},"next":{"title":"主流语言中的函数式编程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/practice/fp-in-mainstream-languages"}}